# WFORMTW.KEY - the item form's drop-down lists: Category, Status,
# Condition and Works; TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/WFORMTW.SNP.
# F4: item 1 in view mode, each list's row in a read-only control.
K F4
S VIEW
K ESC
# F3: item 1 in edit mode, the focus on Category, SYS selected.
K F3
S EDIT
# C selects the next row starting with it: CPU, then CARD.
T C
S TYPEC1
T C
S TYPEC2
# F4 drops the list; Esc on it closes it, CARD selected again however
# far the list was moved.  Alt+Down drops it; Enter on it closes it on
# the row shown, DRV, the dialog staying; Up goes back to CARD.
K F4 DOWN DOWN ESC
S DROPESC
K ALT-DOWN DOWN ENTER
S DROPOK
K UP
S DROPUP
# Condition from GD up to its blank first row.
K ALT-I UP UP UP
S CONDNONE
# OK saves CARD and no condition: the item read again in view mode,
# then in edit mode once more.
K ENTER
S SAVED
K ENTER F3
S REOPEN
K ESC
S DONE
